### B2B order - multiple products
POST http://localhost:5000/api/b2b/orders
X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY
X-API-Secret: YOUR_API_SECRET
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        {
            "product_id": 1,
            "quantity": 10
        },
        {
            "product_id": 2,
            "quantity": 5
        }
    ]
}

### B2B order - invalid credentials
POST http://localhost:5000/api/b2b/orders
X-API-Key: invalid-key
X-API-Secret: invalid-secret
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "items": [
        {
            "product_id": 1,
            "quantity": 1
        }
    ]
}